                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf3ea9c5-96f0-3a17-a972-5376059eef5f",
                                        "entry_id": "a8537ccf-85af-3dc8-be21-a5ea72326c7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A binary chemical compound of oxygen with another chemical element."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c5e33a9-716b-4a75-898a-9985aea5b0c7",
                                                "sense_id": "bf3ea9c5-96f0-3a17-a972-5376059eef5f",
                                                "text": "In general, the hydroxamates are used for flotation of oxidic minerals (pyrochlore, cassiterite and ilmenite), rare-earth oxides and oxide copper minerals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97fb70b7-02cf-4193-972c-a14e0be22820",
                                                "sense_id": "bf3ea9c5-96f0-3a17-a972-5376059eef5f",
                                                "text": "In fact, nitric oxide (not to be confused with nitrous oxide, or laughing gas) is one of our primary signalling molecules."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1992cbf0-1905-4d82-a406-a651b14f0d26",
                                                "sense_id": "bf3ea9c5-96f0-3a17-a972-5376059eef5f",
                                                "text": "On social media and beyond, many have taken to using the brand’s name in a more colloquial fashion, with “Galaxy Gas” being used as a catchall for nitrous oxide inhalants at large, regardless of whether they are actually Galaxy Gas products or not."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "efec6004-27b8-486b-a46f-25dd45735a14",
                        "source_entry_id": "8dac168c-2508-3147-aafe-73b6d14d19ad",
